sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Event writer (mark_paid / trades.apply / refund / PATCH /me)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as Worker (emails queue)
    participant R as Resend

    E->>DB: BEGIN, the event + INSERT email_outbox (unique per order and kind) + NOTIFY emails
    E->>DB: COMMIT (the row and the wake-up land together, or neither)
    DB-->>W: NOTIFY emails (or the poll tick)
    W->>DB: claim due rows FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, attempts + 1, book next_attempt_at, COMMIT
    W->>DB: read the row and the user (verified address? still the same?)
    alt no verified address
        W->>DB: status = skipped
    else
        W->>R: POST /emails (Idempotency-Key = row id), no lock or transaction held
        alt sent
            W->>DB: status = sent, provider id
        else 4xx (not 429)
            W->>DB: status = failed (EmailsFailing)
        else timeout / 429 / 5xx
            W->>DB: keep pending (retry at the booked time, failed after the 6th)
        end
    end
